      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Your tummy is tender in the lower right, and there's a mild fullness, and I can feel your spleen tip.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:24",
      "end_timestamp": "03:34",
      "supports": [
        "physical_examination[0]",
        "physical_examination[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "I don't think so. A prolonged fever rising each evening, a slow pulse for the temperature, abdominal pain, after travel to South Asia, and street food, makes me think of typhoid fever.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:40",
      "end_timestamp": "03:56",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_assessment[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "It can be, but it's treatable with the right antibiotics. It needs blood cultures to confirm. I'd like to take blood cultures now, and a full set of blood tests, and a stool sample.",
      "start_timestamp": "04:04",
      "end_timestamp": "04:20",
      "supports": [
        "procedures_and_investigations[0]",
        "procedures_and_investigations[1]",
        "clinical_actions[1]",
        "clinical_actions[2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "And I'm going to send you to the infectious diseases ward today, to be admitted, so you can have intravenous antibiotics, and be monitored.",
      "start_timestamp": "04:29",
      "end_timestamp": "04:41",
      "supports": [
        "medications[1]",
        "clinical_actions[0]",
        "clinical_actions[4]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Typhoid can spread through contaminated food and water, so wash your hands thoroughly, don't prepare food for others, and don't share utensils.",
      "start_timestamp": "04:59",
      "end_timestamp": "05:11",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_actions[5]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
